          },
          "mechanism": "Prior prescription for hypertension medicine is a direct consequence of prior diagnosis and represents healthcare intervention after the outcome of interest.",
          "justification": "Similar to Q5.11, prior prescription is a direct consequence of prior diagnosis. Adjustment would introduce bias.",
          "role": "descendant_of_outcome",
          "proxy_for": null,
          "contestable": false
        },
        {
